==Belarusian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|be|poczta||obsolete}}
* {{alt|be|pošta||Łacinka}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|be|zle-ort|почта}}, from {{bor|be|zlw-mpl|poczta}}, ultimately from {{der|be|it|posta}}. Compare {{cog|ru|по́чта}} and {{cog|uk|по́шта}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{be-IPA|по́шта}}
* {{audio|be|Be-пошта.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{be-noun|по́шта<sg>|adj=пашто́вы}}

# [[mail]], [[post]]
#: {{uxi|be|пасла́ць па '''по́шце'''|to mail, to post}}
#: {{uxi|be|разно́сіць '''по́шту'''|to deliver the mail}}
#: {{uxi|be|палява́я '''по́шта'''|field post}}
#: {{uxi|be|ляту́чая '''по́шта'''|airmail}}
#* {{RQ:be:s|Dziadźka Anton (1892)|page=14
|Ciapier budzim rachawać tak, szto akcyzu za tabaku, harbatu, cukier, za listy, szto '''poczta''' wozić, telegrapy, my niczoha nia płacim, a płaciać tolki kupcy i pany;
|Now we are going to do calculations, assuming that we are not paying excise duties on tobacco, tea and sugar. We also assume that we are not paying anything for letters carried by the '''post''' and for telegraph services. Only merchants and landlords are making these payments.}}

